# Mona AI - Bengali Voice Companion

Mona is an emotional and real-time Bengali AI voice companion built with Python, Ollama, Edge-TTS, and CustomTkinter.

## Features
- Bengali Speech Recognition
- Natural Bengali Voice Synthesis (Edge-TTS)
- Real-time LLM Streaming using Ollama
- Clean modular architecture

## How to Run
1. Install dependencies: `pip install -r requirements.txt`
2. Ensure Ollama is running with your chosen model.
3. Run: `python main.py`